                "message": "✨ Tangle only the literate docs that changed\n\nsp-tangle-changed compares a SHA-1 of each module doc with the one stored\nin tangle-hashes.eld (sp-cache-dir) and tangles only the stale ones.\nAdds sp-tangle-changed-and-reload and sp-tangle-on-save-mode, and makes\nsp-tangle-all tangle every module doc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBo9meNfQTQJaUvhx2",
